rif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
Unless the SEAT WG has adopted the document (and hence the name of the draf=
t changes to draft-ietf-seat-early-attestation, then this is NOT an IETF do=
cument and hence it is incorrect to say that the SEAT WG is &quot;working o=
n it&quot;. &nbsp;The only status that this draft
 has is that it is an idea from a set of authors which they would like the =
SEAT WG to consider. &nbsp;Anyone can submit a draft for consideration by t=
he WG. &nbsp;Perhaps the authors will consider your patch, perhaps they won=
't. &nbsp;It is up to them since they are currently
 solely responsible for the document, not the SEAT WG, nor the IETF.</div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; font-family: Aptos, Arial, Helvetica, sans-se=
rif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
<br>
